  <div class="review-prose mt-8">
    <h2>India Streaming Availability</h2>
    <p>
      "Where to watch in India" listings on review pages are powered by JustWatch regional watch provider data supplied via the TMDB API (region code <code>IN</code>). Availability across Netflix, Prime Video, JioHotstar, ZEE5, SonyLIV, and rental storefronts is refreshed whenever the site rebuilds.
    </p>
